vidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d141\"},\"ref\":\"d141\",\"snippet\":\" ... The history of the famous Breck shampoo ads, plus 25 iconic vintage Breck Girl images\\n\\nModel turned actor: Young Mark Harmon\\n\\nHere is former football star and future NCIS star Mark Harmon around 1978, going shirtless for Baxter of California Super Shape Skin Conditioner for Men.\\n\\nHere's ... \",\"title\":\"https://clickamericana.com/topics/celebrities-famous-people/model-to-actor-before-they-were-famous\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d138\"},\"ref\":\"d138\",\"snippet\":\" ... Mark Harmon - Wikipedia\\nauthor: Authority control databases\\ndate: 2004-06-21\\n---\\nname: Mark Harmon\\nbirth_name: Thomas Mark Harmon\\nbirth_date: 2 September 1951\\nbirth_place: Burbank, California, U.S.\\nalma mater: University of California, Los Angeles (BA)\\noccupation: Actor, producer, director, author\\nyears_active: 1970–present\\nspouse ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Harmon\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d130\"},\"ref\":\"d130\",\"snippet\":\" ... Also the fact that the Harmon brothers are linked to this project make it seem like its a total case of nepotism at its finest. Probably Richard Harmon did his sister a favor but it shows he didn't put any effort into his acting and it's ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt20116668/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d125\"},\"ref\":\"d125\",\"snippet\":\" ... The actor has a long history with Dan Harmon, having starred in the pilot of Harmon and Rob Schwab's Heat Vision and Jack and guesting on Community.\\n\\nDaniel Radcliffe\\n\\nKnight of the Sun\\n\\nDaniel Radcliffe is another major celebrity who seems perfectly in tune with Rick and ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.denofgeek.com/tv/rick-and-morty-voice-actors-guide/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d143\"},\"ref\":\"d143\",\"snippet\":\" ... Biography of David James Elliott (excerpt)\\n\\nDavid James Elliott (born David William Smith on September 21, 1960 in Milton, Ontario, Canada) is a Canadian-born actor who was the star of the series JAG from 1995 to 2005, playing lead character Harmon Rabb Jr. During his teenage years ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.astrotheme.com/celebrities/sun/moon/5/6.htm\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d248\"},\"ref\":\"d248\",\"snippet\":\" ... Before he went on to star in the show NCIS, Harmon played quarterback for the UCLA Bruins for two years, putting together a 17–5 record while under center.\\n\\n9. Forest Whitaker\\n\\nBefore Whitaker became an Academy Award-winning actor, he went to California State Polytechnic University on ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.mensjournal.com/entertainment/20-famous-actors-who-started-out-athletes\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d249\"},\"ref\":\"d249\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2013)\\n\\n- Aug 23 Richard Sanders, American actor (WKRP in Cincinnati - \\\"Les Nessman\\\"), born in Harrisburg, Pennsylvania\\n\\n- Aug 23 Tom Baker, American actor (I, a Man), born in West Virginia (d. 1982)\\n\\n- Aug 23 Tony Bill, American actor (What Really Happened to the Class of '65), born in San ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.onthisday.com/film-tv/birthdays/date/1940\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_